  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Hangfire — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for IBackgroundJobClient.Enqueue and Schedule. Adds client-side resilience that Hangfire's built-in retry (server-side execution only) does not cover. Includes a built-in HangfireTransientErrors predicate covering JobStorageException, TimeoutException, and TaskCanceledException.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "PollyHangfire",
