  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientBackgroundJobClient wraps IBackgroundJobClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Covers Enqueue and Schedule operations with client-side resilience. HangfireTransientErrors.IsTransient covers JobStorageException, TimeoutException, and TaskCanceledException. Supports net6.0, net8.0, net9.0.",
